#N canvas 20 20 7400 5200 12;
#X text 20 20 u_net -- the phone link \, and the only file that talks to the phone: TouchOSC's layout shows the Launchpad's page and controls it (ref/device/phone.md). Outbound it sends the heartbeat \, the mode \, c_steps' state \, c_synth's choice and velocity switch \, the tempo \, and u_song's sections and songs \; inbound it takes a closed vocabulary of seven commands. It writes err \, and nothing else may learn a phone exists., f 58;
#X text 700 20 creation arg 1: the phone's host \, the fallback when phone-ip.sh finds none. arg 2: its OSC receive port \, 8000 for TouchOSC \, never 9000 (its WebDAV) or 4001-4003 (mother's). arg 3: this end's inbound UDP port \, 9001 on the device and different on the Mac. inlet 1: a bang from u_map that flips test mode. inlet 2: c_steps' state \, 130 numbers. inlet 3: c_synth's choice and velocity switch. inlet 4: u_tempo's BPM. inlet 5: u_song's sections \, 22 atoms as a list \, and its songs \, songs <47 atoms>. outlet 1: c_steps \, the drum screen's sync \, snap and select <n> and its pads' vol \, pitch \, randomness and set-track-last <track> <value> \, and its mute and solo <track> <0 or 1> \, and the arrangement screen's num and den <-1 or 1> \, drunk <0-100> \, set-swing and set-last. outlet 2: c_synth \, synth <choice> and velocity <on or off>. outlet 3: u_tempo \, tempo <bpm>. outlet 4: u_song \, the sections page's select \, page \, new \, up \, down \, length \, delete and name \, and the songs page's songs <command> ..., f 58;
#X text 1400 20 State \, never events: every message carries the whole value \, so a dropped datagram is corrected by the next., f 58;
#X text 20 260 Fire and forget: no handshake and no retry \, so the instrument plays the same with no phone. Only the connection retries \, below., f 58;
#X obj 560 660 list append;
#X obj 560 1010 oscformat cutit tempo;
#X obj 560 1060 s \$0-osc;
#X text 300 1150 The tempo is rate-limited to one slot at 20 Hz: u_tempo hands on every BPM the tempo bus carries \, and one sweep of knob 1 is some 200 a second (ref/device/phone.md). The last one goes again on every heartbeat \, and the store starts empty \, so /cutit/tempo carries nothing until the first BPM., f 44;
