#X text 1400 2300 u_net asks where the phone is: phone-ip.sh reads the Organelle's own DHCP lease on its access point \, and falls back to arg 1 anywhere else., f 58;
#X text 2400 2500 The del 700 is the fallback: off-device mac-stubs/shell.pd never replies \, so this connects to the creation argument. It also covers the script failing on the device. A reply stops it., f 58;
#X text 1150 2560 The retry starts at 3000 ms \, after the address resolves (1550 ms on the device \, 2200 on the Mac \, ref/device/phone.md): a metro fires the instant it starts \, and any earlier it sent connect with no host., f 70;
