#X text 20 3880 The inbound vocabulary is closed: seven commands \, all literal route arguments \, and everything else dropped by an unconnected reject. drums \, synth \, tempo \, velocity \, sections and songs pass on whatever follows them \, and c_steps \, c_synth \, u_tempo and u_song refuse what they do not know \, as bad-selector \, bad-synth \, bad-tempo and bad-velocity (Brendan \, 2026-11-04). re-wire \, clear-alert and test-note went when the phone stopped copying the OLED (Brendan \, 2026-11-04). Nothing from the phone reaches the buses: tempo goes to u_tempo by a cord \, and u_tempo writes it. netreceive in 0.49 cannot tell who sent a datagram (Reference \, pure-data)., f 66;
#X text 660 3880 The listen is armed at 2000 ms \, C-9 for a socket: a second bind of one UDP port prints an error \, and the silence gate quits at about 735 ms. The port is \$3 \, so object boxes again., f 66;
#X text 1940 3880 The ack makes the phone's button flash \, so the flash means received. Each branch fires its action off the trigger's right outlet and the ack off its left., f 66;
#X text 2580 3880 One outlet per receiver \, by cords: c_steps \, c_synth \, u_tempo and u_song \, left to right \, since outlet order is x position. sections and songs share u_song's \, songs keeping its word in front. The Volca's test-note outlet went with the diagnostic commands (Brendan \, 2026-11-04)., f 66;
#X text 3220 3880 A missing port is made loud: an absent \$3 would listen on 0 in silence \, so moses 1 sends it to err. C-8, f 66;
