#X text 20 4800 Test mode: a bang on the inlet flips it \, from u_map's test-mode \, held aux and the second key from the bottom or a tap on the Launchpad's Setup. A second flip within 300 ms is dropped: one press of the key can arrive twice \, 5 ms apart (2026-11-03). Every load starts with it off. It puts the phone's line check up in place of its screens. The heartbeat carries it \, so the page shows the Organelle's own state \, and turning it on warns \, so the OLED says so in compose and the log keeps it., f 66;
#X text 1300 4800 result <checklist>-<n>-<verdict> logs a step's verdict as info phone \, in test mode or not \, and is answered with ack result. The trigger acks before it forwards., f 66;
